.git/
# The bridge test tree must NOT reach the image: the runtime never needs it, and
# its e2e suites are excluded from the PUBLIC repo (deploy/ce-export/exclude-paths.txt)
# while the public bridge image builds from this PRIVATE context - shipping them
# would bypass the repo export gates. Pinned by dockerContextHygiene.test.mjs and
# publish-ce.yml's image content gate. Same exclusions as the lane-2 bridge tarballs
# (deploy.yml, deploy-direct.sh).
bridge/test/
bridge/lib/__tests__/
